{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_prediction_induction_prediction_induction", "label": "PREDICTION-INDUCTION: the induction test for Clause 3", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-INDUCTION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A full chained c=1e6 re-walk costs about 2.8 hours and is more than the claim needs; the induction proves the same thing from 34 steps."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_induction_induction_on_z_argument", "label": "Induction on Z: same entrant at every step implies the chained c=1e6 walk reproduces the sealed chain row for row", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-INDUCTION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The walk is deterministic in its reference \u2014 config(Z) = config(Z-1) plus an entrant, the entrant a function of (Z, config(Z-1), c) \u2014 so agreement at every step makes NR-1 follow rigorously rather than by re-measurement."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_induction_cinf_py", "label": "cinf.py (restart-mode walk at c = 1e6)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-INDUCTION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_induction_thirty_four_confounded_steps", "label": "The 34 confounded steps where cfg_from_chain(Z-1) differs from OBSERVED(Z-1)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-INDUCTION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only these are untested: at the other 73 steps the chained reference already equals the observed one and cinf.py agreed 73 of 73."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_induction_no_s_hole_in_chained_reference", "label": "The chained reference has no s-hole, so the 5s/6s artefacts of Z=42,43,45,46,79 must not appear", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-INDUCTION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Their absence is the direct confirmation of CT-2 \u2014 the flag is a property of the reference configuration, not of c."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_prediction_induction_prediction_induction", "target": "recovered_prediction_induction_induction_on_z_argument", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-INDUCTION.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_induction_induction_on_z_argument", "target": "recovered_prediction_induction_thirty_four_confounded_steps", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-INDUCTION.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_induction_prediction_induction", "target": "recovered_prediction_induction_cinf_py", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-INDUCTION.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_induction_prediction_induction", "target": "recovered_prediction_induction_no_s_hole_in_chained_reference", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-INDUCTION.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_induction_induction_on_z_argument", "target": "recovered_prediction_nonrel_cinf_nr_1_ordering_clause_survives", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-INDUCTION.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_induction_prediction_induction", "target": "recovered_predictio